        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.17+MAT.10.18+MAT.10.19+MAT.10.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10.17-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.11+LUK.12.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 12.11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kake entodol ate. Amu keitarasakini intae nkiguanat; neari intae too nkajijik enye e ntumo; nintasheshe te dukuya lbalusini o laiguanak te nkaraki nanu, pee iakuku shakeni te dukuya ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nemeeta nchere meng'asi aalikioo ele rorei supat too loreren pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore pee erikuni intae enkiguana aaitarasaa, eming'aing'ae te dukuya aajo aikijo aa; kake ina naishori intae te ina saa entejo, amu mme intae ooiro, kake Enkiyang'et Sinyati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keitarasaa olalashe olalashe lenye metari metua, neitarasaa menye enkerai enye, nedumakino nkera iloomenye, neitarasaa metari metuata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naa keibayuni intae iltung'ana pooki te nkaraki enkarna ai. Kake ore olong'iri metabaiki enkiting'oto naa keitajeuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Osina kitok oleng",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
