            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kake ore ina olong o ina saa, meetae hoo obo oyiolo, aimeyiolo ninche lmalaika le shumata, nemeyiolo Enkerai e Tung'ani, Papa ake oyiolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entodol ate, enchololoto; amu miyiololo aajo kanu ebau ina kata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.36+LUK.12.37+LUK.12.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 12.36-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiu anaa oltung'ani oshomo elototo, ore elo ti ang, neing'ueiki ilaisiaayiak, neisho ake oltung'ani eramatare enye, neitanap olorrip kishomi meishololoyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enchololoto naa amu miyiololo aajo kanu elotu olopeny enkaji, anaa ae te nteipa, anaa ae te nasirie ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pee melotu ake neluamisho neinepu intae irurara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore ina najoki intae, neijia ajoki pooki: enchololoto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.37"
            ]
          }
        }
